<h1>About</h1>

<p class="lede">
I’m Kyle Murray, a web production and digital experience professional focused on SEO, content architecture, analytics, and AI discoverability.
</p>

<p>
I built AI Search Lab as a working space for exploring how websites can become easier for people, search engines, and AI systems to understand.
</p>

