<section class="about-section">

<h2>What I Do</h2>

<p>
My background sits at the intersection of content operations, CMS architecture, web governance, technical SEO, analytics, and modern web delivery.
</p>

<p>
I’m especially interested in how AI changes discoverability: what gets retrieved, what gets cited, what gets ignored, and how content systems should adapt.
</p>

